649\n        },\n        \"media\": {\n          \"downloadUrl\": null,\n          \"downloadWithoutWatermarkUrl\": null\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"id\": \"7659791909791091999\",\n        \"caption\": \"🚨 **Parents:** Your role in the recruiting process is bigger than you may realize. College coaches often talk with club and high school coaches to learn about a recruit beyond their athletic ability. Those conversations can include character, coachability, and the overall support system around the athlete. The best thing you can do is be supportive, encourage your athlete, and let them take ownership of their recruiting journey. Don't let your behavior become a distraction from everything your athlete has worked so hard to earn. Support them. Trust the process.  #collegerecruiting #recruitingtips #sportsparents #studentathlete #youthsports\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-07T14:25:16.000Z\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@caylawhite_gkedge/video/7659791909791091999\",\n        \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-p-0068-tx2/oAOijCAkItIq9R9gmf2iNIop1E2DKB8yJIiAAi~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:500:800.jpeg?biz_tag=musically_video.video_cover&dr=9638&idc=useast8&ps=13740610&refresh_token=870556e9&shcp=9b759fb9&shp=c1333099&t=4d5b0474&x-expires=1794002400&x-signature=oiHlW%2FWxonaPmeCZaxftJbZOCq0%3D\",\n        \"durationMs\": 46967,\n        \"pinned\": false,\n        \"isAd\": false,\n        \"stats\": {\n          \"views\": 13683,\n          \"likes\": 206,\n          \"comments\": 11,\n          \"shares\": 28,\n          \"saves\": 19\n        },\n        \"media\": {\n          \"downloadUrl\": \"https://v19.tiktokcdn-us.com/7ef6eade6758f43fb680e63a1d22dea5/6aee521b/video/tos/useast8/tos-useast8-ve-0068c001-tx2/oUcNjpAEigBAJqxioAAKZ1DR2LiiICQFIRcOfk/?a=1233&bti=NEBzNTY6QGo6OjZALnAjNDQuYCMxNDNg&&bt=1933&ft=arR-IqgwmILPD12WWPEI3wUl1ApcMeF~O5&mime_type=video_mp4&rc=ZDdkNTQ4OjxmNWk0NjU3NkBpamg5NXA5cmpqPDMz