ns can include character, coachability, and the overall support system around the athlete. The best thing you can do is be supportive, encourage your athlete, and let them take ownership of their recruiting journey. Don't let your behavior become a distraction from everything your athlete has worked so hard to earn. Support them. Trust the process.  #collegerecruiting #recruitingtips #sportsparents #studentathlete #youthsports","createdAt":"2026-07-07T14:25:16.000Z","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@caylawhite_gkedge/video/7659791909791091999","thumbnailUrl":"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-p-0068-tx2/oAOijCAkItIq9R9gmf2iNIop1E2DKB8yJIiAAi~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:500:800.jpeg?biz_tag=musically_video.video_cover&dr=9638&idc=useast8&ps=13740610&refresh_token=870556e9&shcp=9b759fb9&shp=c1333099&t=4d5b0474&x-expires=1794002400&x-signature=oiHlW%2FWxonaPmeCZaxftJbZOCq0%3D","durationMs":46967,"pinned":false,"isAd":false,"stats":{"views":13683,"likes":206,"comments":11,"shares":28,"saves":19},"media":{"downloadUrl":"https://v19.tiktokcdn-us.com/7ef6eade6758f43fb680e63a1d22dea5/6aee521b/video/tos/useast8/tos-useast8-ve-0068c001-tx2/oUcNjpAEigBAJqxioAAKZ1DR2LiiICQFIRcOfk/?a=1233&bti=NEBzNTY6QGo6OjZALnAjNDQuYCMxNDNg&&bt=1933&ft=arR-IqgwmILPD12WWPEI3wUl1ApcMeF~O5&mime_type=video_mp4&rc=ZDdkNTQ4OjxmNWk0NjU3NkBpamg5NXA5cmpqPDMzaTczNEBgYi0vMF9hX2IxMzIwYzAzYSNlNWllMmRjZTNhLS1kMTJzcw%3D%3D&vvpl=1&l=202611061617168E428D9EB566D30D7E00&btag=e00088000","downloadWithoutWatermarkUrl":"https://v19.tiktokcdn-us.com/fc8dc4038efb4f148472c8bc94ac6ad7/6aee521b/video/tos/useast8/tos-useast8-ve-0068c003-tx2/oYEB1JQ2apgoCAjitbRiCkjAihqGNOLIKAfiID/?a=1233&bti=NEBzNTY6QGo6OjZALnAjNDQuYCMxNDNg&&bt=2015&ft=arR-IqgwmILPD12WWPEI3wUl1ApcMeF~O5&mime_type=video_mp4&rc=aDppZjo4Njg6aGhkaDs7aEBpamg5NXA5cmpqPDMzaTczNEA1Xi81XjVfXjExX180MS8uYSNlNWllMmRjZTNhLS1kMTJzcw%3D%3D&vvpl=1&l=202611061617168E428D9EB566D30D7E00&btag=e00088000"}},{"id":"7466126564166487327","caption":"For parents of high s