ecommendation letters, test scores (if submitting), and any other application materials have been received. An application isn’t complete just because it was submitted! ✅ 2. Check the Recommenders and FERPA section of the Common App. Confirm that recommendation requests and other required items have been handled and that there aren’t any outstanding tasks. ✅ 3. Check email regularly. Colleges may contact students about missing materials, important next steps, honors program invitations, or special scholarship opportunities. Missing an email could mean missing an opportunity! Parents, you can help by reminding your student to stay on top of these responsibilities, but make sure THEY take ownership of the process. Hitting submit is not the finish line. Staying organized and following through is just as important. Follow us for more no-nonsense college admissions advice, practical application strategies, and tips to help your teenager navigate the admissions process with confidence. #CollegeAdmissions #CollegeApplications #CommonApp #CollegePlanning #HighSchoolSenior","createdAt":"2026-10-28T21:55:47.000Z","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@dobler.college.co/video/7701840720964996366","thumbnailUrl":"https://p19-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast5-p-85c255-tx/oce7hkApLMJt36zOeNXNHDVFfghAnCBxAC8JEQ~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:500:800.jpeg?biz_tag=musically_video.video_cover&dr=9638&idc=useast8&ps=13740610&refresh_token=fb3cf652&shcp=9b759fb9&shp=c1333099&t=4d5b0474&x-expires=1794002400&x-signature=4CPLrASrgG6d6hA%2BK7R7yYRftM0%3D","durationMs":164900,"pinned":false,"isAd":false,"stats":{"views":64724,"likes":1668,"comments":24,"shares":2132,"saves":1481},"media":{"downloadUrl":"https://v19.tiktokcdn-us.com/13f3c1aff7b428c095f68d0dd0e31365/6aee5291/video/tos/useast5/tos-useast5-v-85c255-tx/oMe4Bf5ywi6SE8bMtQqgiBPiIYBmE5U4vDYSQB/?a=1233&bti=NEBzNTY6QGo6OjZALnAjNDQuYCMxNDNg&&bt=939&ft=arR-IqgwmILPD12WWPEI3wUl1ApcMeF~O5&mime_type=video_mp4&rc=ZzQ2aDc1aThnaDM5NDg6PEBpM2Y0bXM5cn